on count\n\n**Labels:**\n- labels.ts - Get/manage labels\n\n**Cycles (Sprints):**\n- cycles.ts - List cycles for a team\n- cycle-issues.ts - Get issues in a cycle\n\n**Projects:**\n- projects.ts - List all projects\n- project-detail.ts - Get single project\n- update-project.ts - Update project\n- project-milestones.ts - Get project milestones\n\n**Activity:**\n- add-comment.ts - Add comment to issue\n\n**Database:**\n- db.ts - Database connection utility (uses Neon serverless database with `@neondatabase/serverless`)\n\n---\n\n### Technology Stack\n\n**Frontend:**\n- React (components in TSX)\n- Redux Toolkit (state management)\n- CSS (individual CSS files per component)\n\n**Backend:**\n- Netlify Functions (serverless)\n- Neon Database (PostgreSQL-compatible)\n- TypeScript\n\n**Database:**\n- Using `@neondatabase/serverless` library via Neon (configured through `process.env.DATABASE_URL`)\n\n---\n\n### Architecture Overview\n\n**Frontend Structure:**\n- Page-based routing with React Router (11 main pages)\n- Component library of 38 reusable components\n- Redux Toolkit for centralized state management (13 slices)\n- CSS modules for styling\n\n**Backend Architecture:**\n- RESTful API via Netlify Functions\n- 26 serverless endpoints covering:\n  - Authentication\n  - Workspace/Team management\n  - Issue CRUD operations\n  - Project management\n  - Cycle management\n  - Notification handling\n  - Labels/Tags\n  - Comments/Activity\n\n**Key Features Already Built:**\n- Full authentication system (login/signup)\n- Issue tracking with multiple statuses and priorities\n- Team-based organization\n- Project management with progress tracking\n- Sprint/Cycle planning\n- Comments and activity logs\n- Member management\n- Notification system\n- Bulk operations\n- Search functionality\n\n---\n\n### Notes\n\n- The app is fully TypeScript\n- Each page and most components have corresponding CSS files\n- Redux is configured with 13 state slices for different domains\n- Database uses 